{
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 401,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.13,
            0.812,
            0.162
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "参读材料一 随机变量样本值的产生"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.209,
            0.373,
            0.226
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "（一）随机数和伪随机数"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.232,
            0.883,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": "在概率统计的应用中,常需要模拟各种分布的随机变量,即需要产生各种分布随机变量的简单随机样本的样本值.某一分布随机变量的样本值,就称为这一分布的随机数.例如指数分布随机变量的样本值就称为指数分布随机数.特别,区间(0,1)上均匀分布的随机变量的样本值称为均匀分布随机数,简称随机数.我们先来考虑如何产生均匀分布随机数,其他分布随机数一般可以由均匀分布随机数通过变换得到."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.345,
            0.883,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": "产生均匀分布随机数的方法很多,目前使用最广泛的方法是在计算机上利用数学的递推公式来产生.这种按确定性算法得到的序列,不可能是真正来自区间(0,1)上均匀分布的独立同分布样本值序列,我们称它为伪随机数."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.413,
            0.883,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": "在大多数计算机中都装有产生伪随机数序列的算法程序,我们都假设由这些程序产生的伪随机数序列能通过独立性和均匀分布检验,可作为随机数序列来使用,需要时用特定的命令加以调用就是."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.481,
            0.504,
            0.498
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "（二）产生离散型随机变量样本值的方法"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.504,
            0.446,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": "设离散型随机变量 $X$ 具有分布律"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.317,
            0.527,
            0.88,
            0.561
          ],
          "content": "P \\{X = x _ {i} \\} = p _ {i}, \\quad i = 1, 2, \\dots , \\quad \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {\\infty} p _ {i} = 1. \\tag {*_{1}}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_401_equation_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.563,
            0.336,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": "现在来产生 X 的随机数."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.58,
            0.35,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": "先产生伪随机数 u, 令"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.368,
            0.604,
            0.88,
            0.706
          ],
          "content": "X = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} x _ {1}, & u <   p _ {1}, \\\\ x _ {2}, & p _ {1} \\leqslant u <   p _ {1} + p _ {2}, \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots \\\\ x _ {i}, & \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i - 1} p _ {j} \\leqslant u <   \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i} p _ {j}, \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots \\end{array} \\right. \\tag {*_{2}}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_401_equation_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.711,
            0.176,
            0.727
          ],
          "content": "由于"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.185,
            0.732,
            0.828,
            0.771
          ],
          "content": "P \\{X = x _ {i} \\} = P \\Bigl \\{\\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i - 1} p _ {j} \\leqslant u <   \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i} p _ {j} \\Bigr \\} = \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i} p _ {j} - \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {i - 1} p _ {j} = p _ {i}, \\quad i = 1, 2, \\dots ,",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_401_equation_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.777,
            0.356,
            0.794
          ],
          "content": "所以 $X$ 具有给定的分布律."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.8,
            0.882,
            0.839
          ],
          "content": "产生随机变量 $X$ 的样本值也叫做对随机变量 $X$ 进行模拟或抽样，上述模拟离散型随机变量的方法的算法为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.846,
            0.308,
            0.861
          ],
          "content": "产生伪随机数 u."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.868,
            0.384,
            0.884
          ],
          "content": "若  $u < p_{1}$ ，令  $X = x_{1}$ ，停止。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.891,
            0.421,
            0.907
          ],
          "content": "若 $u < p_1 + p_2$ ，令 $X = x_{2}$ ，停止."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 402,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.049,
            0.201,
            0.063
          ],
          "content": "· 388 ·"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.342,
            0.048,
            0.646,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": "参读材料一 随机变量样本值的产生"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.088,
            0.446,
            0.106
          ],
          "content": "若 $u < p_1 + p_2 + p_3$ ，令 $X = x_{3}$ ，停止."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.113,
            0.2,
            0.123
          ],
          "content": "... ... ..."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.132,
            0.427,
            0.149
          ],
          "content": "例1 设随机变量 $X$ 具有分布律"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.322,
            0.16,
            0.667,
            0.196
          ],
          "content": "| X=i | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| pi | 0.20 | 0.15 | 0.25 | 0.40 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_402_table_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.217,
            0.285,
            0.233
          ],
          "content": "试产生 X 的样本值."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.239,
            0.417,
            0.256
          ],
          "content": "解 取算法为:产生伪随机数 u."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.261,
            0.378,
            0.277
          ],
          "content": "若 u<0.20, 令 X=1, 停止."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.283,
            0.378,
            0.299
          ],
          "content": "若 u<0.35, 令 X=2, 停止."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.305,
            0.378,
            0.321
          ],
          "content": "若 u<0.60, 令 X=3, 停止."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.327,
            0.28,
            0.343
          ],
          "content": "否则,令 X=4."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.349,
            0.427,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": "例2 设随机变量 $X$ 具有分布律"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.365,
            0.37,
            0.866,
            0.4
          ],
          "content": "P \\{X = i \\} = \\frac {1}{n}, \\quad i = 1, 2, \\dots , n, \\tag {*_{3}}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_402_equation_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.41,
            0.728,
            0.427
          ],
          "content": "试产生 X 的样本值(X 称为取值为  $1,2,\\cdots,n$  的离散型均匀分布随机变量)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.436,
            0.867,
            0.486
          ],
          "content": "解 在 $(\\ast_{1})$ 式中，令 $x_{i}=i,i=1,2,\\cdots,n;p_{1}=p_{2}=\\cdots=p_{n}=\\frac{1}{n}$ ，就得到 $(\\ast_{3})$ 式。再由 $(\\ast_{2})$ 式，得"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.492,
            0.824,
            0.522
          ],
          "content": "若 $\\frac{i-1}{n}\\leqslant u<\\frac{i}{n}$ ，则令X=i，即若 $i-1\\leqslant nu<i$ ，则令 $X=i=[nu]+1,i=1,2,\\cdots,n.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.528,
            0.641,
            0.546
          ],
          "content": "因此，若 $u$ 是伪随机数，则 $X = [nu] + 1$ 就是分布 $(\\ast_{3})$ 的样本值."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.551,
            0.621,
            0.568
          ],
          "content": "例 3 试产生以 n, p 为参数的二项分布  $b(n, p)$  的样本值."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.573,
            0.761,
            0.59
          ],
          "content": "解 设  $U_{1}, U_{2}, \\cdots, U_{n}$  相互独立，且它们都在区间  $(0,1)$  上服从均匀分布. 令"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.351,
            0.595,
            0.634,
            0.629
          ],
          "content": "X _ {i} = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 1, & U _ {i} <   p, \\\\ 0, & U _ {i} \\geqslant p, \\end{array} \\right. i = 1, 2, \\dots , n,",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_402_equation_20.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.632,
            0.868,
            0.711
          ],
          "content": "则有  $P\\{X_{i}=1\\}=P\\{U_{i}<p\\}=p, P\\{X_{i}=0\\}=1-p$ ，故  $X_{i}\\sim b(1,p)$ 。又因  $U_{1}, U_{2}, \\cdots, U_{n}$  相互独立，故有  $X=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_{i}\\sim b(n,p)$ 。据此，只要产生 n 个伪随机数  $u_{1}, u_{2}, \\cdots, u_{n}$ ，统计其中使得  $u_{i}<p$  ( $i=1,2,\\cdots,n$ ) 的个数为 k，则得 X 的样本值为 k。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.716,
            0.487,
            0.733
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "（三）产生连续型随机变量样本值的方法"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.738,
            0.298,
            0.754
          ],
          "content": "先证明一个定理."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.76,
            0.868,
            0.798
          ],
          "content": "定理 设随机变量  $U \\sim U(0,1)$ ,  $F(x)$  是某一随机变量的分布函数, 且  $F(x)$  为严格单调增加且连续的函数, 则随机变量  $F^{-1}(U)$  具有分布函数  $F(x)$ , 其中  $F^{-1}(x)$  是  $F(x)$  的反函数."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.804,
            0.867,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": "证 由于 $F(x)$ 严格单调增加且连续，因此其反函数 $F^{-1}(x)$ 存在（即有 $F[F^{-1}(x)] = x$），且严格单调增加并连续，即得随机变量 $F^{-1}(U)$ 的分布函数为"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.321,
            0.847,
            0.66,
            0.887
          ],
          "content": "\\begin{array}{l} P \\{F ^ {- 1} (U) \\leqslant x \\} = P \\{F [ F ^ {- 1} (U) ] \\leqslant F (x) \\} \\\\ = P \\{U \\leqslant F (x) \\} = F (x). \\\\ \\end{array}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_402_equation_26.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.893,
            0.866,
            0.91
          ],
          "content": "由定理,若要产生以  $F(x)(F(x)$  严格单调增加且连续)为分布函数的随机变量 X, 只需"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 403,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.357,
            0.048,
            0.663,
            0.064
          ],
          "content": "参读材料一 随机变量样本值的产生"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.802,
            0.049,
            0.867,
            0.063
          ],
          "content": "· 389 ·"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.087,
            0.884,
            0.149
          ],
          "continues_prev": true,
          "content": "产生 $U \\sim U(0,1)$，令 $X = F^{-1}(U)$ 就行了。又若要产生 $X$ 的样本值 $x$，只需产生 $U$ 的样本值 $u$，令 $x = F^{-1}(u)$ 即得。这一产生 $X$ 的样本值的方法，称为逆变换法。这种方法在随机变量具有严格单调增加且连续的分布函数 $F(x)$ 且 $F^{-1}(x)$ 能够用显式表示时，都能使用。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.153,
            0.884,
            0.193
          ],
          "content": "说明: 在上述定理中对  $F(x)$  在  $(-\\infty, \\infty)$  上的严格单调连续的要求可放宽为  $F(x)$  在某一区间(有限或无限)上取值从 0 到 1，并在此区间上严格单调增加且连续即可."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.197,
            0.584,
            0.213
          ],
          "content": "例 4 设随机变量 X 具有指数分布, 其分布函数为"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.367,
            0.215,
            0.652,
            0.248
          ],
          "content": "F (x) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 1 - \\mathrm{e} ^ {- x / \\theta}, & x > 0, \\\\ 0, & \\text {其他}, \\end{array} \\right. \\quad \\theta > 0,",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_equation_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.247,
            0.297,
            0.264
          ],
          "content": "试产生随机变量 X."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.269,
            0.512,
            0.286
          ],
          "content": "解 设  $U \\sim U(0,1)$ ，令  $U = 1 - e^{-X/\\theta}$ ，解得"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.291,
            0.579,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": "X = - \\theta \\ln (1 - U).",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_equation_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.313,
            0.57,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": "因为当 $U \\sim U(0,1)$ 时，也有 $1 - U \\sim U(0,1)$，从而"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.46,
            0.335,
            0.56,
            0.351
          ],
          "content": "X = - \\theta \\ln U",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_equation_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.357,
            0.806,
            0.374
          ],
          "content": "就是所要产生的指数分布的随机变量. 只要有伪随机数 $u$, 就有 $X$ 的随机数 $-\\theta \\ln u$."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.862,
            0.358,
            0.882,
            0.373
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_image_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.379,
            0.602,
            0.396
          ],
          "content": "例 5 设随机变量 X 具有韦布尔分布, 其分布函数为"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.334,
            0.399,
            0.68,
            0.441
          ],
          "content": "F (x) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} 1 - \\mathrm{e} ^ {- (x / \\eta) ^ {\\beta}}, & x > 0, \\\\ 0, & \\text {其他}, \\end{array} \\right. \\quad \\beta > 0, \\eta > 0.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_equation_14.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.445,
            0.297,
            0.461
          ],
          "content": "试产生随机变量 X."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.465,
            0.531,
            0.484
          ],
          "content": "解 设 $U \\sim U(0,1)$, 令 $U = 1 - \\mathrm{e}^{-(X / \\eta)^{\\beta}}$, 解得"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.416,
            0.488,
            0.598,
            0.508
          ],
          "content": "X = \\eta [ - \\ln (1 - U) ] ^ {1 / \\beta}.",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_equation_17.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.51,
            0.331,
            0.527
          ],
          "content": "因为 $1 - U\\sim U(0,1)$ ，故"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.44,
            0.532,
            0.578,
            0.551
          ],
          "content": "X = \\eta (- \\ln U) ^ {1 / \\beta}",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_equation_19.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.555,
            0.466,
            0.572
          ],
          "content": "就是所要产生的韦布尔分布的随机变量."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.862,
            0.556,
            0.882,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_image_21.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.577,
            0.404,
            0.594
          ],
          "content": "例 6 正态随机变量的产生."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.599,
            0.884,
            0.637
          ],
          "content": "标准正态变量的分布函数 $\\Phi (x)$ 的反函数不存在显式，故不能用逆变换法产生标准正态变量.下面介绍一种近似方法."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.643,
            0.884,
            0.681
          ],
          "content": "设  $U_{i} \\sim U(0,1), i=1,2,\\cdots,n$ ，且它们相互独立，由于  $E(U_{i})=1/2, D(U_{i})=1/12$ ，由中心极限定理，当 n 较大时近似地有"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.385,
            0.684,
            0.622,
            0.753
          ],
          "content": "Z = \\frac {\\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {n} U _ {i} - \\frac {n}{2}}{\\sqrt {n} \\sqrt {\\frac {1}{1 2}}} \\sim N (0, 1).",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_equation_25.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.754,
            0.312,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": "取 n=12, 知近似地有"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.393,
            0.77,
            0.618,
            0.807
          ],
          "content": "Z = \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {1 2} U _ {i} - 6 \\sim N (0, 1),",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_equation_27.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.806,
            0.884,
            0.845
          ],
          "content": "这就是说，只需产生12个伪随机数 $u_{1}, u_{2}, \\cdots, u_{12}$，将它们加起来，再减去6，就能近似地得到标准正态变量的样本值了。这样做是很方便的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.849,
            0.53,
            0.867
          ],
          "content": "又若 $X \\sim N(\\mu, \\sigma^2), Z \\sim N(0,1)$，利用关系式"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.466,
            0.871,
            0.554,
            0.889
          ],
          "content": "X = \\mu + \\sigma Z",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0401-0416/images/page_403_equation_30.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.894,
            0.489,
            0.911
          ],
          "content": "就能得到一般的正态随机变量 X 的样本值."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
